[ext_resource type="Script" path="res://scripts/ames_train.gd" id="1_train"]

; T-194: the daily coal drag (the world stages exactly one on the chained
; south track). The primitive rig is built in the script's setup (the
; consist schedule + one unit-box MultiMesh; rotations stay in code per the
; scene-file convention); the world hands the train its route before the
; physics ticks advance the loop clock. No physics body on purpose — the
; T-194 scope guard: the train is dressing that moves, it gates nothing.

[node name="CoalDrag" type="Node3D"]
